translate brazil ch5sc12_653784e5:

#   am "I took off my panties when I got into bed last night."
    am "Tirei minha calcinha quando me deitei na cama ontem à noite."

# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc12.rpy:42
translate brazil ch5sc12_7a2b7b99:

#   am "Left them right there on the floor with my blouse."
    am "Deixei-os ali mesmo no chão, junto com a minha blusa."

# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc12.rpy:44
translate brazil ch5sc12_6e031569:

#   am "This morning, my blouse is still there but my panties are gone. Poof!"
    am "Esta manhã, minha blusa ainda está aqui, mas minha calcinha sumiu. Puf!"

# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc12.rpy:45
translate brazil ch5sc12_00561b52:

#   am "And the only difference between last night and every other night is... {b}you{/b}."
    am "E a única diferença entre a noite passada e todas as outras noites é... {b} você{/b}."

# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc12.rpy:47
translate brazil ch5sc12_1846beeb:

#   mc "Well... I didn’t take them, and I've never even been inside your room."
    mc "Bem... eu não os peguei e nunca nem sequer entrei no seu quarto."

# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc12.rpy:48
translate brazil ch5sc12_5f16a350:

#   mc "But we have had reports from other women in Luxenford who've said their panties have gone missing recently."
