#   "Amelia stomps her foot and shoots you a menacing glare."
    "Amelia bate o pé e lança-lhe um olhar ameaçador."

# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc12.rpy:63
translate brazil ch5sc12_6614f2ef:

#   mc "Okay! Okay... fine. I’ll see what I can do."
